 <h3><u>Ali ke chahne wale khushi aise manate hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>ali ali ali ali ali Haider..(2)<br> Haider haider haider</p> 
  <p>Ali k chahne wale khushi aise manate he<br> lagate haideri naare jo chehre muskurate he</p> 
  <p>1. hamari bandagi maula hamari zindagi maula<br> nabi ne kehdiya maula jisse bus he wahi maula<br> sikhaya maa ne apni looriyo me yaa ali maula<br> ghadeere kum ka kissa apne bacho ko sunate he</p> 
  <p>2. khula karta he haj ke darmiya khushiyo ka darwaza<br> tawaf aisa he hota jhumta he khaanaye kaaba<br> dilome azmate tauheed lab par ya ali maula<br> khuda k ghar ali paida huwe sabko batate he</p> 
  <p>3. jo kehlata he momin karbala ka he wo bashinda<br> mazalim k mukabil khoon se rehta he payinda<br> ali par jaan dekar ye hamesha hogaye zinda<br> shaheedo k to chehre b kafan me muskurate he</p> 
  <p>4. koi bhooda b aajaye to wo hokar jawaa uthe<br> dilo se naaraye haider zami ta asma uthe<br> mere har shair par dilse munafik k dua uthe<br> jo munkir he ali k unko lafzo se jalate he</p> 
  <p>5. musalsal koshisho k batbi nakaam tha lashkar<br> alam jisko payamber se mila wo mard he haider<br> mawali sab ikhatte hogaye he saj gaya khaiber<br> jo shachi baat hoti he wohi sabko batate he</p> 
  <p>6. bhulaya tha shabe meraaj jisko haqne apna tha<br> bohot nazdik tha mehboob bus kehne ko parda tha<br> khuda ne baat ki jisme bohot manoos lehja tha<br> ali ki thi anghuti aur ali ka haath dekha tha<br> bohot khush he nabi meraaj se tashreef laate he</p> 
  <p>7. yaha he sakiye kausar yaha jannat k dar b he<br> malaik he yaha maujood aur jinno bashar b he<br> fazayai he yaha athar ali safdar kamar b he<br> ye aisi bazm he jisme<br> imame asr aate he</p> 
  <p>8. jo apne rokh ko pehle dinse hi haider se moode he<br> ali k daig ko dekha to kitni taiz doode he<br> faraar aise huwa aage k peeche unke ghoode he<br> hum unka zikr karte he jo aadhi bhagoode he<br> hai adat baagne ki jinko hum unko bhagate he</p> 
  <p>9. yahi rakhte he rooze raat din he ye dua karte<br> fariza khums ka har toor se he ye ada karte<br> ali waale nahi hargiz namazo ko kaza karte<br> namazome khuda k samne sar ko jhukate he</p> 
